*                                                              XA0054DK         
* VXWALK (BAL R9): R7 = VIRTUAL ADDRESS, R3 = GUEST STD.       XA0054DK         
* R0 = 0: R6 = GUEST REAL FRAME, R15 = ITS PROTECT BIT;        XA0054DK         
* ELSE R0 = PROGRAM INTERRUPTION CODE (10, 11, 12, 5).         XA0054DK         
*                                                              XA0054DK         
VXWALK   ST    R9,VXLNKW                                       XA0054DK         
         LR    R1,R7                                           XA0054DK         
         SRL   R1,20                                           XA0054DK         
         N     R1,=F'2047'    SEGMENT INDEX                    XA0054DK         
         LR    R4,R3                                           XA0054DK         
